  "created": "2026-08-04T19:12:01.97Z",
  "description": "A .NET 10 redistribution of the Roboto Mono monospace font family, packaged for the CodeBrix family. Ships the Roboto Mono variable font plus 10 static .ttf files (Light/Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold weights in Normal/Italic styles), and three companion fonts that extend coverage beyond what Roboto Mono itself carries: Noto Sans Mono (polytonic Greek), Iosevka (the Armenian script, in the Extended width grade that matches Roboto Mono's 0.6 em character advance), and Noto Sans Georgian (the Georgian script). Includes a font .ttf.manifest JSON per family and a buildTransitive .targets file that prunes the unused static font set at consumer-build time. The whole package, code and fonts alike, is distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.",
  "iconFile": "icon-codebrix-128.png",
